    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Foley Auctioneers are delighted to offer to the market this Charming 3/4 Bedroom Bungalow on c.1.3 Acres with unlimited potential.\r\n\r\nIdeally located, the property enjoys excellent connectivity, with the M3 and M4 motorways just a short drive away. Dublin City Centre and Dublin Airport are both accessible within 30 minutes, offering the perfect balance of peaceful rural living and commuter convenience.\r\nSet on a generous site of approximately 1.3 acres, this charming home offers an exceptional opportunity to enjoy spacious country living while remaining within easy reach of Dublin and major transport routes.\r\n\r\nThe well-maintained home features bright, well-proportioned accommodation, with flexible living space and a number of reception rooms.\r\n\r\nSome of the property's standout features include a number of outbuildings, a large garden/paddock, yard space & vegetable patches.\r\nThese substantial outbuildings and purpose-built kennels, provide an excellent opportunities for a variety of business ventures, workshops and storage.\r\nThe large garden/paddock area presents future site potential subject to the necessary planning permission, making this an attractive prospect for those seeking long-term value."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch| 2.0m x 2.4m\r\nEntrance Hallway| 2.3m x 3.4m Wood flooring, coving\r\nKitchen/Dining| 4.5m x 7.0m Tiled floor, tiled backsplash, patio doors to garden\r\nSitting Room| 4.4m x 7.0m Carpeted, open fireplace with solid fuel stove, coving\r\nLiving/Games Room| 4.4m x 6.0m Carpeted, open fireplace\r\n\r\nBedroom 1| 4.7m x 7.0m Wood flooring, build in wardrobes, downlighters, coving\r\nEn Suite| 1.4m x 2.5m Tiled, shower unit\r\nBedroom 2| 3.8m x 2.8m Carpeted\r\nBedroom 3 & 4| 5.9m x 2.7m Carpeted (currently converted into one larger bedroom)\r\nBathroom| 2.4m x 2.8m Fully tiled, bath"
      },
      {
